     <period-end iso-date="2026-12-12"></period-end>
     <target value="30">
      <comment>
       <narrative xml:lang="EN">In progress. DHSUD, with support from the Bank is updating its Guidelines on developing resilient urban design strategies. The PlanSmart for Sustainable Human Settlements under development will capture the urban design strategies of local governments to ensure its integration in their CLUPs. Consultants were hired to support DHSUD carry out the planned activities. Information source: DHSUD</narrative>
